<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>This is for Thy house and city,</l><l>This is for Thy kingdom, Lord;</l><l>To subdue the earth before us</l><l>We are all in one accord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Of the Father, through Christ Jesus,</l><l>By the Spirit’s flowing free;</l><l>In our spirit, on the church-ground—</l><l>This the way of victory.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Burden us with Thy great plan, Lord;</l><l>Consecrated we would be.</l><l>To fulfill Thy holy purpose</l><l>Saturate us thoroughly.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Build, O build us all together,</l><l>Let us here our lessons learn,</l><l>Send us forth to many cities</l><l>For the church-life there to burn.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Many places need a beachhead</l><l>To bring in Thy reign and rule.</l><l>Lord, build up the local churches</l><l>That Thy kingdom come in full!</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Then the earth will give Thee glory</l><l>And the devil get the shame.</l><l>For Thy kingdom’s rule and reigning</l><l>All will praise Thy glorious name.</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Blessed days are quickly coming;</l><l>We rejoice and give Thee praise</l><l>For the glorious consummation</l><l>And Thy royal ruling days.</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>Hallelujah to the Father,</l><l>Hallelujah to the Son,</l><l>Hallelujah to the Spirit—</l><l>Hallelujah, it is done!</l></lg>
<lg label="10."><l>Hallelujah for the churches,</l><l>Hallelujah for the saints,</l><l>Hallelujah for the meetings</l><l>And their holy, sweet constraints!</l></lg>
<lg label="11."><l>Hallelujah, hallelujah,</l><l>Hallelujah we will sing;</l><l>Hallelujah, hallelujah,</l><l>Hallelujah to our King!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
